   "line": [
    "e6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The gambit gets declined instead: propping the centre with c6 is the Slav, while the alternative of e6 is the Queen's Gambit Declined. Two respectable ways to say no to the pawn.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
