   "line": [
    "Nc3",
    "Nf6",
    "Nf3",
    "c6"
   ],
   "spoken": "That e6 shores up control of d5 and frees the dark-squared bishop to come out. This is the bedrock of the opening — deploy the army. Think of it as a war: pieces sitting idle on their starting squares win nothing; they have to be marched to active posts before any attack on the king is possible."
  },
