   "spoken": "A piece of counting advice: when deciding if a capture works, don't just tally attackers against defenders — it depends on what specifically is doing the attacking. There may be more attackers than defenders on the pawn, yet recapturing with the queen is impossible, because the queen herself would fall. Win the pawn that way and you've traded a queen for it — a medal for the wrong achievement.",
