   "line": [],
   "spoken": "Now a framework worth internalising — undefended pieces come in two flavours. A type-one is a piece with no defenders at all. A type-two is defended by only one other piece, and pawns don't count as defenders. Spotting both in every position is how tactics announce themselves.",
   "kind": "tactic",
   "reanchor": true
  },
